          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. What protective devices can be used during sexual activity to reduce the spread of STIs?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.701,
            0.839,
            0.921,
            0.903
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. If a couple uses oral contraceptive pills but not condoms, which risks remain and why?"
            }
          ]
